/production/2a714c68e60047c56165dcfaabbb4f50468f7c83-652x1500.jpg\",\"isPrimeExclusive\":false,\"originalPrice\":1287,\"rating\":4.6,\"reviewCount\":77475,\"title\":\"SanDisk 2TB Extreme Portable SSD (SDSSDE61-2T00-G25)\"},{\"_createdAt\":\"2026-01-29T15:47:16Z\",\"_id\":\"b68d29aa-cc70-4882-baa7-f8cc7bf5a22a\",\"_type\":\"deal\",\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/48QApU3\",\"category\":\"Electronics\",\"couponCode\":\"ADCBRS15\",\"couponNote\":\"15% max AED100| ADCB Mastercard Cards\",\"dealEndDate\":\"2026-02-14T15:49:00.000Z\",\"dealPrice\":54,\"description\":\"Lowest price recorded in 30 days! Experience powerful sound with 10mm drivers and \\\"Big Bass\\\" technology. These earbuds offer an impressive 30-hour playtime, IPX5 water resistance for workouts, and AI-enhanced clear calls. Customize your audio with 22 EQ presets via the Soundcore app. A perfect daily driver at an unbeatable price.\",\"discountPercentage\":40,\"featured\":true,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/886d391c1a9caa3f5e86a80fc81de8f9d73cd1b2-1251x1500.jpg\",\"isPrimeExclusive\":false,\"originalPrice\":90,\"rating\":4.2,\"reviewCount\":90699,\"title\":\"Soundcore Anker P20i - 40% OFF Flash Sale\"},{\"_createdAt\":\"2026-01-25T11:09:55Z\",\"_id\":\"133bbfcc-a6e7-4f2a-9f94-06b743e887bd\",\"_type\":\"deal\",\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4bcmskO\",\"category\":\"Electronics\",\"couponCode\":\"FAB15\",\"couponNote\":\"15% max AED75|FAB Mastercard Credit cards. Enter code FAB15 at checkout.\",\"dealEndDate\":\"2026-02-24T11:11:00.000Z\",\"dealPrice\":1117,\"description\":\"Huge price drop! Grab the industry-leading Sony WH-1000XM6 headphones for just AED 1122.40 This is the lowest recorded price in 3 months, saving you over AED 300 off the standard retail price. Perfect for commuters and travelers.\",\"discountPercentage\":34,\"featured\":true,\"image\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/aaf7ffe536e9ada28532b32ba76c7ce520462fb5-991x1500.jpg\",\"isPrim